-- Cell (4,1,1) is inactive. It sits inside the FLUX region, which is the case
-- that distinguishes a region defined over all grid cells from the set of
-- cells that actually take part in the flow. Flow can still pass the column at
-- i=4 through j=2 and j=3.
ACTNUM
  3*1 0 29*1 /

-- Region 1 covers i = 3..5 for every j.
FLUXNUM
  2*0 3*1 6*0
  2*0 3*1 6*0
  2*0 3*1 6*0 /

